{"seq":8,"slug":"applied-cryptography","title":"应用密码学","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 应用密码学 简介\n\n密码学常被想象成一堆深奥的数学公式，但「应用密码学」关心的是另一件更落地的事：这些算法如何被组装成保护真实系统的工具，又如何在工程中被用对而非用错。当你访问一个网站、发一条加密消息、登录一个账户，背后都有一整套密码学机制在默默运转。本 hub 的目标，是带一位有几年经验的开发者把这套机制从原理到实践彻底看通——既知道每个原语在数学上保证了什么，也知道在代码里哪一步千万不能错。\n\n整个 hub 按四个递进的层次组织，每一层都建立在前一层之上。第一层「密码学基础」打地基：对称加密如何高速保护批量数据、哈希与 MAC 如何提供完整性与认证、随机数与熵为何是一切安全的隐秘命门。这三者是后续所有协议的零件，离开它们什么都搭不起来。\n\n第二层「公钥密码」解决基础层留下的死结——对称加密要求双方先共享密钥，可密钥本身怎么安全送达？公钥密码用一对公私钥破解了这个难题：从 RSA 的大整数分解，到椭圆曲线用更短密钥换同等安全，再到密钥交换与数字签名这两件支撑数字信任的利器。这一层是连接「原语」与「协议」的枢纽。\n\n第三层「协议与应用」把前两层的零件组装成真实世界每天在跑的系统：TLS 如何在不可信网络上建立安全通道、PKI 如何用证书和信任链解决「公钥到底属于谁」、端到端加密如何让连服务器都看不到内容。这一层展示了密码学原语如何被精密编排成可用、可信、可持续的协议。\n\n第四层「前沿与实践」望向未来也回望工程现实：后量子密码应对量子计算机对 RSA/ECC 的致命威胁、零知识证明与同态加密开辟「使用中数据」的隐私新疆域、而密码工程与误用则把全 hub 反复出现的「这里别错」汇成系统纪律。最后一篇尤其重要——它提醒读者，密码系统沦陷几乎从不因算法被破，而总因用错。\n\n四层之间不是孤立的章节，而是层层咬合的链条：基础是零件，公钥是枢纽，协议是成品，前沿是演进与守正。读完它们，你不仅理解密码学「是什么」，更理解它在 2026 年的真实系统里「怎么被正确地用」。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"密码学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"symmetric-encryption","title":"对称加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations/symmetric-encryption"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hash-mac","title":"哈希与消息认证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations/hash-mac"},{"seq":3,"slug":"randomness-entropy","title":"随机数与熵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations/randomness-entropy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-key","title":"公钥密码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rsa-public-key","title":"公钥原理与 RSA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/rsa-public-key"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elliptic-curve","title":"椭圆曲线密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/elliptic-curve"},{"seq":3,"slug":"key-exchange-signatures","title":"密钥交换与数字签名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/public-key/key-exchange-signatures"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"protocols","title":"协议与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tls-secure-comm","title":"TLS 与安全通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/protocols/tls-secure-comm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"authentication-pki","title":"认证与 PKI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/protocols/authentication-pki"},{"seq":3,"slug":"end-to-end-encryption","title":"端到端加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/protocols/end-to-end-encryption"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontier","title":"前沿与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/frontier","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"post-quantum","title":"后量子密码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/frontier/post-quantum"},{"seq":2,"slug":"zkp-homomorphic","title":"零知识证明与同态加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/frontier/zkp-homomorphic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crypto-engineering-misuse","title":"密码工程与误用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/frontier/crypto-engineering-misuse"}]}]}